you will likely need to update your version of glfw on the host system, ImGui requires at least glfw version 3.4.

To do this download the source
cd to directory, add a folder named build
run--
cmake -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON -S . -B build
cmake --build build
cd build
sudo make install

add this to  bashrc
export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH

